    "Port list: one card per listening port, showing the port number, process name, address, PID badge, and user, with a terminate button on the right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Port list: one card per listening port, showing the port number, process name, address, PID badge, and user, with a terminate button on the right."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「端口列表」:每个监听端口一张卡片,显示端口号、进程名、地址、PID 徽章和用户,右侧为结束进程按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「連接埠列表」:每個監聽連接埠一張卡片,顯示連接埠號、程序名稱、位址、PID 徽章和使用者,右側為結束程序按鈕。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「連接埠列表」:每個監聽連接埠一張卡片,顯示連接埠號、程序名稱、位址、PID 徽章和使用者,右側為結束程序按鈕。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「連接埠列表」:每個監聽連接埠一張卡片,顯示連接埠號、程序名稱、位址、PID 徽章和使用者,右側為結束程序按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
